<%- include('header') %>
<h1>Customer relationship</h1><p><a href="/prospects/<%= p.id %>"><%= p.opp %> - <%= p.business_name %></a></p>
<p>Opportunity type: <strong><%= engagementTypes[p.engagement_type]||(p.service_lane==='Managed IT'?'Managed IT':'BII / Standardization') %></strong>. <a href="/prospects/<%= p.id %>/edit">Review / correct type</a></p>
<p>One SharePoint client may have several sales opportunities. Linking reuses the client identity and existing folders.</p>
<% if(error){ %><p class="error"><%= error %></p><% } %>
<% if(p.client_id){ %><p>This opportunity is linked to <%= p.client_id %>. The client cannot be reassigned.</p><% }else{ %>
<form method="get"><label>Find a SharePoint client by company name or Client ID<input name="q" value="<%= q %>"></label><button>Search</button></form>
<form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
<% if(p.engagement_type){ %><input type="hidden" name="original_engagement_type" value="<%= p.engagement_type %>"><% } %>
<label><input type="radio" name="relationship_type" value="new_client" checked>New customer</label>
<label><input type="radio" name="relationship_type" value="existing_client">Existing customer / additional service</label>
<label>Existing SharePoint client<select name="client_id"><option value="">Explicitly select a client</option><% for(const c of clients){ %><option value="<%= c['Client ID'] %>"><%= c.Title %> - <%= c['Client ID'] %> - <%= c['Current Stage'] %> - <%= c['Service Lanes'] %> - <%= c['Stage Status'] %> - <%= c['Next Action'] %></option><% } %></select></label>
<label>New service workflow lane<select name="service_lane" <%= project?'disabled':'' %>><% for(const lane of lanes){ %><option value="<%= lane %>" <%= (project?'Project-Based':p.service_lane)===lane?'selected':'' %>><%= lane==='Project-Based'?'Project-Based (Project / Hourly)':lane %></option><% } %></select></label>
<% if(project){ %><input type="hidden" name="service_lane" value="Project-Based"><p>Project-Based is selected automatically for Project and Hourly / Break-Fix. Linking reuses the customer record and does not start managed workflows.</p><% }else{ %><p>Selecting Project-Based corrects this open opportunity to One-Time Project, preserving discovery history and requiring review of the new intake. Quotes or started SharePoint workflows prevent incompatible type changes.</p><% } %>
<p>Project/hourly opportunities reuse the selected customer and their own work authorization. Managed IT/BII opportunities retain their additional-service discovery and transition checks.</p><button>Save customer relationship</button></form><% } %>
<%- include('footer') %>
